Package: dagric-tools
Version: 1.1.2
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Dagric OS Project <repo@dagric.com>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: kdialog, python3, qml-qt6, gettext-base
Description: Dagric OS tools, wizard, manual and appearance drop-ins
 The Dagric layer itself: the first-run setup wizard, the Dagric Hub, the
 appearance gallery, Styles and Looks, the Migration Assistant, Check This PC,
 the offline manual and guide, and the consent-install helpers.
 .
 This is the package that carries fixes to the product to machines that are
 already installed. The other three cover the look, the desktop defaults and
 the security baseline; without this one an owner who installed last month
 would never receive a corrected wizard or a new manual page.
